[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457079035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98830#issuecomment-2457079035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98830","id":2457079035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SdAz7","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T12:47:10Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T12:47:10Z","body":"This is not a bug, the fields you mentioned are not booleans but enums[^1][^2]. It just so happens to work due to implicit conversions making `OFF = 0 = false` and `ON = 1 = true`.\r\n\r\nBut with strict typing (e.g. gdscript knows that there is a type mismatch), it definitely should error for these assignments out of the box. Not every enum represents \"on/off with additional values\", so IMO it's a feature request to allow these conversions with strict typing enabled.\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_basematerial3d.html#class-basematerial3d-property-transparency\r\n[^2]: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_geometryinstance3d.html#class-geometryinstance3d-property-cast-shadow","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457079035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457095858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98830#issuecomment-2457095858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98830","id":2457095858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SdE6y","user":{"login":"kester-habermann","id":9316765,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTY3NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9316765?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann","html_url":"https://github.com/kester-habermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kester-habermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T12:55:21Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T12:55:21Z","body":"My bad, I didn't look closely enough at the documentation. I was really under the impression that these were supposed to be booleans. Thanks for the quick reply! I try it with strict typing and using the correct enum values.","author_association":"NONE","pin":